	(text "GPIO MAP (nRF9161 PS Table 55)\nEXP_A J16: P0.00-P0.15 + VDD_GPIO + GND\nEXP_B J17: P0.16-P0.31 + MAGPIO0 + COEX0 + GND\nMODEM J18: MAGPIO0-2, MIPI_SDATA/SCLK/VIO, COEX1-2\nOnboard (not exclusive): P0.00-03 LEDs, P0.08 USER, P0.07 SIM_CD DNP\nSuggested mux: UART P0.26-29, SPI P0.13-16, I2C P0.30-31, I2S/PDM P0.17-20, ADC AIN0-7 = P0.13-20"
